Technical Build Notes

- WordPress as CMS
- Custom Post Type: Listings
- Taxonomies: Listing Type, Location/Sub-location
- Fields: Gallery, Contact, Price, Amenities, Vehicle Type
- Recommended Plugins: ACF, WPGraphQL, Yoast SEO/RankMath
- Headless Frontend: Astro or similar
- Mobile-first design
- Image optimisation: WebP recommended
